  "summary": "Goth Punk (ゴスパンク) is a Japanese fashion style that combines elements of Goth and Punk .",
  "description": "Goth Punk (ゴスパンク) is a Japanese fashion style that combines elements of Goth and Punk . In international spaces, it is often confused for Visual Kei fashion. The style was most popular with fans of visual kei bands in the 2000s.",
